      "Why Not Kept": "TRNG_FIFO only fixes FIFO_DEPTH at build time and cannot be changed or withheld at run time, so it is excluded as a build-time value (lines 22 and 147)."
    },
    {
      "Candidate Name": "Simulation-mode setting",
      "Candidate Unit": "neorv32_trng",
      "Merged Into": "",
      "Why Not Kept": "SIM_MODE is a build-time generic rather than run-time information that an element can modify or withhold, despite selecting the simulated path at lines 132 and 444-451."
    },
    {
      "Candidate Name": "Bus access command and handshake",
      "Candidate Unit": "neorv32_trng",
